2955	2972	2206	2206	Harriet	30	" I do think it is , without exception , the best charade I ever read . "
2973	2985	2206	2206	Harriet	30	" I never read one more to the purpose , certainly . "
2986	3000	2187	2188	Mr. Elton	29	" It is as long again as almost all we have had before . "
