4127	4204	3957	3957	he	35	" Aye , very true . -- I wish I could recollect more of it . Kitty , a fair but frozen maid . The name makes me think of poor Isabella ; for she was very near being christened Catherine after her grandmama . I hope we shall have her here next week . Have you thought , my dear , where you shall put her-- and what room there will be for the children ? "
